                <pb facs="0214" n="112" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg112"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 774/416.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Beaupré to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The
                            Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-11-27"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">November 27,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Government of the Netherlands agrees to the postponement to February 1 of
                    International Opium Conference, but desires to be informed when new date is
                    fixed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
